# Surge reject.list for ads, trackers, telemetry, and noisy beacons
# Generated: 2026-06-03
# AUTHOR: JovanyKoch
# Usage in [Rule]:
# RULE-SET,https://example.com/reject.list,REJECT
# or local:
# RULE-SET,reject.list,REJECT
#
# Notes:
# - This is a policy-less external RULE-SET. Bind REJECT / REJECT-DROP / REJECT-NO-DROP in the parent RULE-SET line.
# - The list intentionally avoids blocking primary product domains such as douyin.com, facebook.com, and music.163.com.
# - If a service breaks, check the matched rule in Surge's recent requests and whitelist the smallest domain needed.

